; short of the door at col 4), by the door (col 3, auto, on the girl holding the guitar out at x 72, 80 px wide and
; 24 px short of the door: the song, the
; hummed return) and at the guitar (col 9, auto: the played return). The guitar beats are under Beats.

; Indoors: wood planks, so no earth turf lip shows; no interior grows grass (systems/grass).

